Subject: [PATCH 2798/3799] soh: rename D_80116268 -> sDustVelocity

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the velocity Actor_SpawnWoodDustAtPos passes
Defined in soh/src/code/z_actor.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/code/z_actor.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/code/z_actor.c b/soh/src/code/z_actor.c
index f2e91f8fe..e91e37884 100644
--- a/soh/src/code/z_actor.c
+++ b/soh/src/code/z_actor.c
@@ -4804,7 +4804,8 @@ void Actor_SpawnWoodDust(PlayState* play, Vec3f* pos, Vec3f* velocity, Vec3f* ac
     EffectSsKiraKira_SpawnSmall(play, pos, velocity, accel, &color1, &color2);
 }
 
-Vec3f D_80116268 = { 0.0f, -1.5f, 0.0f };
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was D_80116268: the velocity Actor_SpawnWoodDustAtPos passes
+Vec3f sDustVelocity = { 0.0f, -1.5f, 0.0f };  // was D_80116268 [LLM:HIGH]
 Vec3f D_80116274 = { 0.0f, -0.2f, 0.0f };
 
 Gfx D_80116280[] = {
@@ -4816,7 +4817,7 @@ Gfx D_80116280[] = {
 
 // LLM generated name (GUESS), was func_800355B8: Actor_SpawnWoodDust with the file's shared velocity and acceleration
 void Actor_SpawnWoodDustAtPos(PlayState* play, Vec3f* pos) {
-    Actor_SpawnWoodDust(play, pos, &D_80116268, &D_80116274);  // was func_8003555C [LLM:GUESS]
+    Actor_SpawnWoodDust(play, pos, &sDustVelocity, &D_80116274);  // was func_8003555C [LLM:GUESS]
 }
 
 // LLM generated name (GUESS), was func_800355E4: true for a player-type AC collider while meleeWeaponAnimation is 0x16; that animation number is not otherwise named
